○ ob-ljh · Benchmark runner CLI with context sweep, warmup, repeats, and percentiles   [● P0 · OPEN]
Type: task
Created: 2026-08-02 · Updated: 2026-08-02

DESCRIPTION

  Sweep 4K, 32K, 128K, and 262K contexts with configurable warmup and repeat  
  counts, emitting per-repeat rows in the frozen schema. Report percentiles   
  rather than best runs. Each context point must be independently useful so a 
  truncated sweep still yields publishable data.                              



